---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到">
  <section class="animate-fade-up flex flex-col items-start py-16 sm:py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">
      这里暂时没有内容
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary">
      你访问的页面可能已经移动或删除，可以回到首页继续浏览。
    </p>
    <a
      href="/"
      class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-canvas transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
    >
      <span aria-hidden="true">←</span>
      <span>返回首页</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
